# TechHive Software Solutions

A full-stack technology services web application developed as a group project for the **Small IT Business** module.

TechHive Software Solutions provides a modern platform where customers can explore technology services, submit service booking requests, send enquiries, and receive booking confirmations. The application also includes an administrative dashboard for viewing bookings and customer enquiries.

---

## Project Overview

The project was developed to demonstrate how a modern full-stack web application can integrate a responsive frontend, RESTful backend APIs, and a relational MySQL database.

### Application Flow

```text
Customer
   ↓
React Frontend
   ↓
Axios
   ↓
Express REST API
   ↓
MySQL Database